{"actor_id":"chris-perkins-nmcitra","event_type":"EVIDENCE_ANCHORED","timestamp":"2026-07-27T10:45:00-06:00","anchor_id":"anchor-0001","covers_through_event":"ev-000014","anchor_status":"ANCHOR_PENDING","note":"Anchoring capability adopted. Manifest anchor-0001 commits the ledger through ev-000014, the registry tree, and the measured roadmap status. Recorded after the manifest, necessarily: a manifest cannot commit the hash of a ledger that already contains the event describing it. Status is ANCHOR_PENDING — the OpenTimestamps client is not yet installed, so the digest is fixed but not yet submitted to a calendar server.","event_id":"ev-000015","prev_hash":"e304669c7831484ae108f6673a9601e801991b2068f8196c49d28e677f4a44ff","content_hash":"aae1d6953e3da8a36d8ebe1e43656965ab1085d29b635ff2bfeca89dce220fc3"}
{"actor_id":"chris-perkins-nmcitra","event_type":"PROPOSAL_CREATED","proposal_id":"OTCS-0003","timestamp":"2026-07-27T13:10:00-06:00","note":"Model revision: split the coordinate vector into three layers (coordinates, governance intent, functions). Opened as a separate proposal rather than folded into OTCS-0002, whose subject is unrelated; bundling would force anyone objecting to one to object to both. 45-day floor, earliest ratification 2026-09-10.","event_id":"ev-000016","prev_hash":"aae1d6953e3da8a36d8ebe1e43656965ab1085d29b635ff2bfeca89dce220fc3","content_hash":"0eb960c5b79abd4ba25a3431c194af8b8dacc7455481805db67567cbc9843b97"}
{"actor_id":"chris-perkins-nmcitra","event_type":"RECORD_UPDATED","timestamp":"2026-07-28T20:55:00-06:00","note":"relationship.schema.json gains otcs_observed status, non_claims and observed_source. Until now a one-sided registry observation about projects that had not consented was unrecordable: additionalProperties was false, there was no status for it, and no field to state its limits. That blocked the whole observed-record path gated to v2.2. An otcs_observed edge is now required to carry both its non-claims and its sources; the schema refuses it otherwise.","event_id":"ev-000017","prev_hash":"0eb960c5b79abd4ba25a3431c194af8b8dacc7455481805db67567cbc9843b97","content_hash":"875899e649e9e9c6c492dad14ff60fd1648f566bbf157eaffdb6914915e25c29"}
